	(text "3  FILAMENT 2: AL8860 BUCK, 0.1 V / 0.33 R = 303 mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.75 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "035bf56e-a8fc-5d39-a5ca-3a3e5a0bb8dd")
	)
	(text "1  USB-C INPUT: 5 V SINK, NO PD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0cdd9339-daed-5ad7-9ac1-e2e673b55739")
	)
	(text "Test points: TP1 +5V  TP2 GND  TP3 DIM_CTRL  TP4 +3V3  TP5 RADAR_OT2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "12572a95-eac7-592e-bae8-c20dbe930bad")
	)
	(text "Rd = 5.1 k on CC1 and CC2 (separate resistors): the bank supplies 5 V.\nNo PD negotiation, so no part here can ever see more than 5.5 V from a\ncompliant source. Works with USB-C banks and with USB-A to C cables.\nF1: 0.75 A hold / 1.5 A trip. Normal max 0.42 A lit; keep-alive pulses\nonly run when the lamp draws < 120 mA. D1 DNP: fit only if a hot-plug\ntest shows > 6.5 V on +5V (its leakage would cost idle current)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.42 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "18cafcb4-ece6-5af6-94e8-b230e3b8c5c4")
	)
	(text "D4 lets the board feed the XIAO's 5V pin (Seeed requires a diode)\nand blocks back-feed when the XIAO's own USB-C is plugged in.\nStrapping pins D0/D8/D9 and UART0 D6/D7 are left unconnected.\nFootprint has only the 14 edge pads: the underside pads\n(VBAT, EN, JTAG) are omitted so nothing can short to them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "225722d6-6fd9-5faf-9847-56433187f400")
	)
	(text "H1-H4: M3, place to suit the frame"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3d5e8bef-ae50-5746-89db-68b03f466567")
	)
	(text "Power: one 5 V rail from the bank. Lit 2.06 W (411 mA),\nidle ~1.1 mA + 3 mA keep-alive (model: power_model.py).\n\nPins (XIAO):\n  D1 GPIO3  ADC_POT    ADC1_CH3\n  D2 GPIO4  DIM_PWM    LEDC 19.5 kHz, 11-bit\n  D3 GPIO5  RADAR_OT2  light-sleep wake, high = present\n  D4 GPIO6  UART_TX -> radar RX (115200 8N1)\n  D5 GPIO7  UART_RX <- radar OT1/TX\n  D10 GPIO10 KA_DRV    keep-alive gate\n\nConnectors (JST-PH 2.0, through-hole, hand-soldered):\n  J2 pot, J3 radar, J4/J5 filaments (pin 1 = +, anode)\n\nTest on the first board (design_review.md, section 6):\n  TP3 < 0.2 V with the XIAO held in reset\n  each filament 303 mA +/- 5 % at full brightness\n  AL8860, L, R12 < 60 C after 45 min in the frame\n\nDNP: D1. JLCPCB places everything except U1 and J2-J5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4f177944-9187-56fc-a0be-6190a5794fc0")
	)
	(text "5  BRIGHTNESS POT AND RADAR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 204.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "772f688a-77ef-5d1b-acd8-4c53cc1b96ce")
	)
	(text "4  MCU: SEEED XIAO ESP32C3 (hand-soldered)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2d1a79a-5e65-598b-bfab-9aa4bcccbdb6")
	)
	(text "7  BANK KEEP-ALIVE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237.49 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a67a26b2-6370-5f2e-af2d-80dbf91cb687")
	)
	(text "Loop: +5V -> R4 -> filament -> L2 -> SW; D3 returns to +5V.\nFilament + is NOT ground-referenced. Never tie a lead to GND or the frame.\nLayout: tight VIN cap / Rs / L / D loop; Kelvin-route Rs to VIN and SET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "acddf801-bbc2-5fd8-9351-10eca3daca5c")
	)
	(text "Analog (default): 19.5 kHz PWM -> RC -> DC on CTRL.\nV_CTRL = 2.70 V x duty. AL8860: 0.3-2.5 V = 0-100 %,\n< 0.2 V off, > 2.5 V clamps at 100 %.\nFlicker-free; ripple ~19 mV p-p; tau 1.8 ms.\nPWM fallback: leave C7 off, PWM <= 500 Hz.\nR9 holds CTRL at 0 V while D2 floats (reset,\nflashing, panic, light sleep) -> filaments dark."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c1f19282-5802-57f5-9b77-111a20aee82d")
	)
	(text "152 mA for 200 ms every 10 s (3 mA avg)\nwhenever the load is below ~120 mA:\ndark, or dimmed below ~25 %.\nQ1/R10/R11/R12 may be DNP for a bank\nproven to stay on without it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c97b0ac4-0ca7-5e80-b67a-abe461d562a6")
	)
	(text "Loop: +5V -> R3 -> filament -> L1 -> SW; D2 returns to +5V.\nFilament + is NOT ground-referenced. Never tie a lead to GND or the frame.\nLayout: tight VIN cap / Rs / L / D loop; Kelvin-route Rs to VIN and SET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e445c6b5-7339-5359-b6f6-ee18257c4099")
	)
	(text "Pot: 100 k linear across 47 k + pot -> wiper 0-2.24 V\n(inside the C3's linear ADC range). 22 uA standing.\nR6 + C6: ESD and sampling filter if a panel knob is used.\nJ3 is 1:1 with the LD2410S header: 1 3V3, 2 GND,\n3 OT1/TX, 4 RX, 5 OT2. R7 holds the wake pin low\nif the radar is unplugged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ee50d463-cc3c-555b-b512-14b349b6d987")
	)
	(text "2  FILAMENT 1: AL8860 BUCK, 0.1 V / 0.33 R = 303 mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.75 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f0a16ecf-64da-5ded-aa5c-b142dbe6f486")
	)
